        "official_en_sha256": "df7eed1bb0ae086b2b4897bfced4d7503970be145b53f04b018f53489e820162"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "各キャラクターには強さの指標となるステータスがあります\r\n\r\n物理攻撃力：物理攻撃技の与ダメージに影響します\r\n物理防御力：物理攻撃技の被ダメージに影響します\r\n魔法攻撃力：魔法攻撃技の与ダメージに影響します\r\n魔法防御力：魔法攻撃技の被ダメージに影響します\r\n神聖力　　：回復魔法や光魔法攻撃の効果に影響します",
        "official_en": "Each character has attributes that denote their battle\r\ncapabilities.\r\n\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Physical attack: </>\r\nAffects damage dealt with physical attacks.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Physical defense:</>\r\nAffects damage received from physical attacks.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Magic attack:</>\r\nAffects damage dealt with magic attacks.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Magic defense:</>\r\nAffects damage received from magic attacks.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Sanctity: </>\r\nAffects healing magic and Light magic attacks.",
        "real_en": null
      },
